## 20. Activating Validation with `@Valid`

Controller:

```java
@PostMapping("/preview")
public PaymentResponse preview(
        @Valid
        @RequestBody
        PaymentRequest request) {

    ...
}
```

`@Valid` triggers Bean Validation after binding/deserialization.

